# Google Calendar OAuth tokens (tools/setup_google_calendar.py's output,
# one file per account -- see google_calendar_accounts.py) -- real,
# refreshable credentials, same sensitivity as .env's secrets. The accounts
# list itself names no secret (just labels + calendar IDs + paths to the
# tokens above) but is still host-specific deployment config, not source.
google_calendar_token_*.json
google_calendar_accounts.json

# Cloned TTS voice clips (POCKETTTS_VOICE=<name> -> voices/<name>.wav).
voices/*.wav*
